[{"title":"寄界系师","author":"释函可","text":"少小参寻老大僧，云山历尽碧层层。\n关东白日寒如水，欲寄清凉照古藤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46306,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄功檀行者","author":"释函可","text":"如何仍滞故人家，念汝辛勤泪点沙。\n归语故园诸弟妹，孤僧未死海东涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46307,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜雨怀傅陈二子二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"风雨同床定赋诗，诗中定话苦相思。\n老僧恨不冲泥过，只恐天晴又别之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46308,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜雨怀傅陈二子二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"无雨无风愁寂寂，大风大雨益凄其。\n不知绝塞如何好，便使同床泪亦披。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46309,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诸子访耀寰不遇","author":"释函可","text":"车马全无户半开，寻山应到日西回。\n儿童不用询名姓，定是吾侪三五来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46310,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇送耀寰","author":"释函可","text":"赠别惭无金匼匝，白团新墨共淋漓。\n移家不少王侯贵，那得吾曹半句诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46311,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题铁岭花楼","author":"释函可","text":"貂锦何年去画楼，楼前荆棘满空秋。\n行人立马一抬首，叠笏还疑在上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46312,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋燕","author":"释函可","text":"海水苍茫何处归，深秋犹自傍人飞。\n旧时王谢皆泥土，只恐重来我又非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46313,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻宗尉为戴子直冤","author":"释函可","text":"耐尽冰寒鬓已霜，春风一点到穷荒。\n委缣仅见方义尉，更有何人赎仲翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46314,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠寿光三公子","author":"释函可","text":"炯炯双眸气食牛，最怜未解说边愁。\n他时得返弦歌地，却望寒冰是旧丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46315,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀寒还","author":"释函可","text":"数载交游一瞬休，计程应说到皇州。\n乡关重雾难回首，何处霜风不是愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46316,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送戴三","author":"释函可","text":"半揖鞭梢雪载途，怀中一幅流民图。\n金鸡计日传边海，肯逊缇萦却丈夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46317,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"解嘲","author":"释函可","text":"莫笑孤僧老更狂，平生奇遇一天霜。\n不因李白重遭谪，那得题诗到夜郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46318,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问我存病","author":"释函可","text":"残躯何异委寒林，绛帐萧条夜雪深。\n独有病魔无冷煖，长边万里亦相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46319,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀苗鍊师","author":"释函可","text":"一度关门便是仙，才经两月已千年。\n鹤飞纵有归来日，只恐人民未必然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46320,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻薪夷游豫章","author":"释函可","text":"最是一身无著处，随风直向大江西。\n匡庐山下子曾住，应访茆堂过虎溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46321,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春前一日","author":"释函可","text":"腊尽依然处海滨，寒风破衲易相亲。\n年来历日浑无据，未必明朝便是春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46322,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祀灶","author":"释函可","text":"绝塞为神亦可怜，一瓢冰雪献尊前。\n经年佳节同寒食，莫把清贫诉上天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46323,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春","author":"释函可","text":"清晓开门泪已披，梅花一别永无期。\n寒冰到死为朋友，便是春来也不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46324,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上偶成","author":"释函可","text":"寒炉拨尽漏声微，独卧泥床揽毳衣。\n枕上岭梅三百树，一时化作雪花飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46325,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"我存晓过","author":"释函可","text":"春来安得到柴扉，望断孤云更不飞。\n寒泪满眶无地洒，却将数点湿僧衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46326,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中怀太翁","author":"释函可","text":"开门三尺没空阶，欲问袁安愿又乖。\n自是雪深堪葬骨，更无馀地著吾侪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46327,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦拈香","author":"释函可","text":"野臣负罪海东偏，羞搭袈裟见佛天。\n一瓣心香和泪举，不知何处祝尧年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46328,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻我存得仲氏馈贻","author":"释函可","text":"抖擞曾无一寸毡，只将双眼看残年。\n邻翁斗粟浑閒事，续得寒儒命一线。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46329,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"释函可","text":"今年更比去年穷，梦到梅花香亦空。\n抖擞破衾残雪在，无人知道旧家风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46330,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"释函可","text":"食得冰甜岁又新，曾无好意别疏亲。\n从他唾面从他笑，不改南蛮鴂舌人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46331,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丽大师寄梅花诗","author":"释函可","text":"一枝谁折寄辽东，腊尽香残梦久空。\n欲拟报君寒彻骨，祁连雪满月朦胧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46332,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日大风","author":"释函可","text":"年年九日怯登台，此日登台眼独开。\n瞬息塞尘吹欲尽，无人知自大江来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46333,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山怀大来苏筑诸公","author":"释函可","text":"几年相约入千山，万丈枯藤我独攀。\n何日团圞最高处，峰峰收拾破囊还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46334,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题净瓶峰","author":"释函可","text":"案头恰置此孤峰，峰顶何人插古松。\n为问山灵如可借，杖挑随处得相从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46335,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山寄诸子五首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"一到山中便不同，山翁只合住山中。\n山中不尽凭题寄，才欲抒毫色色空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46336,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山寄诸子五首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"寸寸都堪屐齿留，此中何处觅边愁。\n饥来无限青松叶，更汲寒泉煮石头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46337,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山寄诸子五首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"扫石焚香只待君，满溪流水共云云。\n閒愁抖擞涧门外，莫带纤纤乱白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46338,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山寄诸子五首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"千峰残雪挂松杉，月下孤僧经一函。\n何必浮山归便好，病躯今已委寒岩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46339,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山寄诸子五首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"破衲萧萧自一峰，思君斜倚最高松。\n为留一片松间月，间叠溪桥候短筇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46340,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠红鸦","author":"释函可","text":"雪里惊看花独开，燕支山上晓飞回。\n莫怜幽谷寒无柰，为带春光一点来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46341,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别千山","author":"释函可","text":"片云相伴出山扉，拄杖挑将破衲衣。\n为语洞猿长守护，石床茶灶待僧归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46342,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重留龙泉静室","author":"释函可","text":"岩边茆屋出林梢，乱石支床雪半消。\n拗得松枝重洒扫，壁间犹挂旧时瓢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46343,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山遇雪","author":"释函可","text":"去岁到山曾有雪，今年踏雪复登山。\n泉声滴沥还如旧，山共孤僧添老颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46344,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中同诸老夜话","author":"释函可","text":"烧松共话到更深，衣薄钟残雪又侵。\n住得此山非近世，不须重问祖师心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46345,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访无心师","author":"释函可","text":"裂却青衫三十年，孤峰独自抱云眠。\n相逢休问今何代，梦满双眉月满天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46346,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"三月峰头春意微，昼晴时见一鸦飞。\n东沟林外闻人语，野老提筐摘菜归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46347,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"天与空岩养病身，衲衣无复惹红尘。\n故山久已荆榛遍，谁料桃源却在秦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46348,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山杂咏五首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"石人招我上高台，极目中原一点灰。\n半局未收云黯黯，只愁北海又生埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46349,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山杂咏五首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"空传玉匣自神京，大石泉流骨亦清。\n鸟篆残碑风雨后，依稀犹认雪庵名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46350,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山杂咏五首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"枯藤为幕月为阶，半卷莲经伴古崖。\n甲子坐穷寒未了，扫将残雪葬枯骸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46351,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山杂咏五首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"谁把燕支染白云，桃花流水日纷纷。\n秪疑古寺颓垣下，犹压当年蛱蝶裙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46352,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千山杂咏五首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"叹惜前朝五寺僧，云窝占尽一层层。\n即今夜雨青燐遍，疑是琉璃古佛灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46353,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜梅君磊从江南寄诗","author":"释函可","text":"天外何人赠一枝，未曾相识足相思。\n翻怜苏李赓酬处，那得中原几首诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46354,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辽阳回访大翁","author":"释函可","text":"可堪隔别一年期，见面依然霜满髭。\n窖底唱酬良不易，老僧去后更无诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46355,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜遇沈谦受","author":"释函可","text":"孤身绝域守寒毡，尽日无言意悄然。\n自悔罪深馀舌在，见君翻似对枯禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46356,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高寒还叔侄复至","author":"释函可","text":"何意重逢黑水滨，边愁又觉一番新。\n冰霜已是经来惯，况复残僧是故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46357,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云间钱钟二子至","author":"释函可","text":"相将微喘度龙荒，尚有寒冰苦未尝。\n却怪老僧愁不死，殷勤先问耐愁方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46358,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣秋寄诗并双管","author":"释函可","text":"一缄珍重寄辽东，诗卷仍将双管同。\n旧砚已焚无所用，祇应新句伴寒风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46359,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"往辽阳二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"满头短发自离披，正好团圞又别之。\n莫讶一挑霜雪重，袈裟还裹故人诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46360,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"往辽阳二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"平生作戏几逢场，每笑河流尽日忙。\n最是云閒閒不住，又随风雪过辽阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46361,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与诸子约三日春游第三日阻雨二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"非关风雨能相妒，自是人间胜会难。\n不为此番游屐阻，连朝终作等閒看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46362,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与诸子约三日春游第三日阻雨二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"昨宵有约东郊外，枕畔风拖急雨来。\n自此得晴便相过，无花亦到日西回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46363,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨窗读诗娱","author":"释函可","text":"此日闭门惟伏枕，枕边一手把残编。\n谁言绝塞无朋友，纸上相逢百十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46364,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大雪李苗二鍊师同诸子过谈竟日","author":"释函可","text":"莫怨崎岖屐齿艰，但逢好友足开颜。\n囊中谩说长生药，且得浮生一日閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46365,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄江南诸同社四首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"白日歌声满大荒，于今斯道属辽阳。\n翻嫌李白归来早，不得长吟向夜郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46366,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄江南诸同社四首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"谁言雪碛一僧孤，白拂交横沸海隅。\n郑侠若令生此日，竹林莲社总应图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46367,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄江南诸同社四首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"饿到今称饱亦顽，墨台真乐在西山。\n兄酬弟唱知多少，空使薇歌落世间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46368,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄江南诸同社四首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"无罪还应出塞来，石头旧社长蒿莱。\n会稽禹穴饶探遍，不到天山眼不开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46369,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈航偶成二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"曲录偏容老罪夫，天山从此辟荒芜。\n请看自古传灯者，问道曾来九译无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46370,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈航偶成二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"百匝毡裘竞献酥，杖头指处朔风驱。\n介夫若见绫千尺，会写长边说法图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46371,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大翁出塞亦既抱孙矣复连举四子戏赠二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"含饴亦自足欢娱，又见双双挽白须。\n便使郑图添百子，可能代得老翁无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46372,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大翁出塞亦既抱孙矣复连举四子戏赠二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"三年四读洗儿诗，大漠维熊梦亦疲。\n纸笔未穷从所好，只愁风雪夜啼饥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46373,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬我存","author":"释函可","text":"几人风雪共留连，才过清明便不然。\n最苦枕戈人已老，未曾先著祖生鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46374,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄澹归","author":"释函可","text":"曾向瓶窑觅幻身，书来已是法中亲。\n何时飞锡同辽鹤，来问垒垒冢底人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46375,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄阿谁","author":"释函可","text":"谁与天涯作比邻，题诗先问白头人。\n燕支久已无颜色，好写青山置我身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46376,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪闻","author":"释函可","text":"闭门镇日雨声潺，忽听流民尽解颜。\n纵使金鸡连夜发，只愁飞不到云山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46377,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王公六椽庵","author":"释函可","text":"却因罪废觉于于，茶椀残编足自娱。\n室比维摩无一半，屡将香饭致文殊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46378,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄与公三首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"水满春江书满车，单骑何苦问天涯。\n眼前无限悲秋客，独有君心待折花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46379,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄与公三首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"闻君又已离孤寺，毕竟是谁割半毡。\n珍重夜寒应早卧，不须秉烛续残编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46380,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄与公三首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"茆庵灯火旧来过，君自咿唔我自歌。\n他日乘车休下揖，但逢破笠不须呵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46381,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拈笔寄木公","author":"释函可","text":"去年相约莫题诗，收拾残生过好时。\n白雪下来山又冷，不禁孤寺远相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46382,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄慰大翁","author":"释函可","text":"相看白首恨如何，独卧牛衣泪又多。\n瓶口几年知缺尽，不须重击瓦盘歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46383,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄潘公","author":"释函可","text":"万里寒云共掩扉，如何朋好足相依。\n情知乡井无穷泪，恐见伤心不敢挥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46384,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]